{"id":"e66dc18b21503b612546648885d5e916dd07380f","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1240495","title":"Claude 200 订阅怎么才能用的完？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"yexiaoqi","excerpt":"程序员 - @yexiaoqi - 公司开了 claude 200 的订阅，现在好焦虑，每周六重置的时候都还有 40%用不完，平时都是日常开发工作，现在基本上都是全栈开发了，但是日常需求也用不完然后平时维护一下自己的知识库和开发","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div><p>公司开了 claude 200 的订阅，现在好焦虑，每周六重置的时候都还有 40%用不完，\n平时都是日常开发工作，现在基本上都是全栈开发了，但是日常需求也用不完\n然后平时维护一下自己的知识库和开发辅助工具\n但是还是会有每周用不完的情况\n没到周五就开始空想需求来消耗额度</p>\n<p>大家都是怎么做的呢？\n有什么好的方法</p>\n</div><div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/订阅\"><li></li> 订阅</a><a href=\"/tag/开发\"><li></li> 开发</a><a href=\"/tag/消耗\"><li></li> 消耗</a></P><p><span>33 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-09-09 17:06:09 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18063788\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/da17/f416/624982_normal.png?m=1703472963\" alt=\"venomD\" data-uid=\"624982\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/venomD\">venomD</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-08 20:49:26 +08:00\">23h 8m ago via iPhone</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>旱的旱死涝的涝死哈哈哈</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18063793\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6c2b/646b/621283_normal.png?m=1692511549\" alt=\"gpt5\" data-uid=\"621283\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/gpt5\">gpt5</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-08 20:52:00 +08:00\">23h 5m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>不用 fable 的话，确实挺耐用的。<br>不过一旦高强度上 fable 的话，就不够了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18063807\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/0702fd0efaafa81a942de2f345c178fa?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"hoky\" data-uid=\"585657\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/hoky\">hoky</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-08 21:00:51 +08:00\">22h 57m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我的 20x Claude Code 不够用，又开了一个 20x 的 CodeX 备用。同时多开几个 worktree ，多开几个项目搞起。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18063813\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/810b/a1c3/518305_normal.png?m=1787616005\" alt=\"northluo\" data-uid=\"518305\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/northluo\">northluo</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-08 21:03:44 +08:00\">22h 54m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我感觉 20 刀 plus 没有之前耐用了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18063821\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/baeca61f2ea3a1a39bf075e20f61ffe2?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"yexiaoqi\" data-uid=\"836532\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yexiaoqi\">yexiaoqi</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-08 21:08:28 +08:00\">22h 49m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/hoky\">hoky</a> 我就是用 worktree ， 还专门写一个工具，支持多项目一起 worktree ，每当重置前还剩额度的时候就焦虑</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18063824\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/baeca61f2ea3a1a39bf075e20f61ffe2?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"yexiaoqi\" data-uid=\"836532\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yexiaoqi\">yexiaoqi</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-08 21:09:31 +08:00\">22h 48m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/xxxnull\">xxxnull</a> 公司都给开，100 的不够用，就开了 200 ，但是 200 剩点用不完就焦虑</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18063862\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cb7e/d3ff/714531_normal.png?m=1761119463\" alt=\"V2Try\" data-uid=\"714531\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/V2Try\">V2Try</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-08 21:30:39 +08:00\">22h 27m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>让它跑定时任务，每天深夜做一个 app 或者网站</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18063930\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cb7e/d3ff/714531_normal.png?m=1761119463\" alt=\"V2Try\" data-uid=\"714531\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/V2Try\">V2Try</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-08 22:07:36 +08:00\">21h 50m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/yexiaoqi\">yexiaoqi</a> 我也没有，让 ai 自己发挥，之前 openclaw 火的时候我就看人这么玩，每天早上收获一个新应用，其实我也没这样用过😂</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18063948\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/baeca61f2ea3a1a39bf075e20f61ffe2?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"yexiaoqi\" data-uid=\"836532\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yexiaoqi\">yexiaoqi</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-08 22:15:25 +08:00\">21h 42m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/V2Try\">V2Try</a> 硬想一些东西还是很耗精力的 。   我记得有一次 周三用了 80% 。想着剩下省着够周五周六用，谁知道周四早上给重置了。 直接给我干焦虑了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18063987\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7170abb99aec868ab61af8ddb4d71f83?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"gaojiren\" data-uid=\"417274\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>20</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/gaojiren\">gaojiren</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-08 22:39:35 +08:00\">21h 18m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>不知道做什么？那好办了，每天晚上定时让它跑，全网收集大家的创意项目，每天收获一个早报。跑几天，你就找到方向了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18063996\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ca8de5ce310c84ec0abf08eb3f12b068?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Tory12138\" data-uid=\"818002\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>21</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Tory12138\">Tory12138</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-08 22:44:16 +08:00\">21h 13m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我也是，每次周末都是通宵蹬，都快把我累死了，为什么 cc 不能出个 plus 版</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18064969\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/ea75/9dd5/216620_normal.png?m=1738891338\" alt=\"ayyll\" data-uid=\"216620\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>28</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ayyll\">ayyll</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 10:26:18 +08:00\">9h 31m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>为什么要蹬完  我公司开了一个 5x  我让同事 ssh 到我的电脑上一起用 两人蹬也就每天 50%-60%，很少有蹬满的时候，我基本上 6 点就下班了，一天最多蹬个 5-6 小时，差不多 27 天的时候封号了(是因为我的那个梯子波动，节点 ip 一直跳给封了) 统计